OL,3,GNEWSALucy Letby hospital could have
OL,4,Aprevented some baby deaths, inquiry
OL,5,Afinds
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe deaths of some babies at the
OL,8,Fhospital where killer nurse Lucy Letby
OL,9,Fworked could have been prevented, an
OL,10,Finquiry finds
OL,12,FThere was a "complete failure to
OL,13,Fprotect babies" at the Countess of
OL,14,FChester Hospital, Thirlwall says in her
OL,15,Freport, and it will never be possible
OL,16,Fto know for certain how many lives
OL,17,Fcould have been saved
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,405,400,260,160,0,100
PN,40402
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F404A1789473367
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSALucy Letby hospital could have
OL,4,Aprevented some baby deaths, inquiry
OL,5,Afinds
OL,6,
OL,7,FThirlwall blames "dysfunctional
OL,8,Fmanagement" at the hospital and a
OL,9,F"failure to understand the fundamentals
OL,10,Fof safeguarding" - key takeaways from
OL,11,Fthe report
OL,13,FThe hospital's executives "failed in
OL,14,Fthe duty of candour with parents,
OL,15,Finvestigators and regulators". Tony
OL,16,FChambers - who resigned as the hospital
OL,17,Ftrust's chief in 2018 - had a
OL,18,F"dictatorial" manner, the report says
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,405,400,260,160,0,100
PN,40403
SC,0003
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F404A1789473367
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSALucy Letby hospital could have
OL,4,Aprevented some baby deaths, inquiry
OL,5,Afinds
OL,6,
OL,7,FThirlwall also says parents of the
OL,8,Fbabies were "kept in the dark for
OL,9,Fyears" over concerns that their
OL,10,Fchildren may have been deliberately
OL,11,Fharmed
OL,13,FLetby is serving 15 whole-life prison
OL,14,Fterms for murdering seven babies and
OL,15,Fattempting to murder seven more. She
OL,16,Fwas convicted in 2023 and has been
OL,17,Fdenied permission to appeal against her
OL,18,Fconvictions twice
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/3
